==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16~32 seconds<sup>480f~960f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 8~16 seconds<sup>240f~480f</sup>.
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Ms. Madonna]] spawns as the boss.
**12 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 4~8 seconds<sup>120f~240f</sup>.
**4 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
As this stage contains only of [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemies, you should bring some [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red units]]. As for Madonna herself, try not to meatshield in order to reduce the amount of [[Wave Attack]]s she is able to do.

